.TH MU2E-VIEWER.YAML 5 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-dataformat-viewer t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
mu2e-viewer.yaml \- configuration of the data format viewer and sender
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I config/mu2e\-viewer.yaml
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read by
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.py (1)
and
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-sender.py (1)
through
.IR config/config.py .
Values are deep-merged over built-in defaults, so every key is optional.
.PP
Without
.BR \-\-config ,
the first existing file among
.IR ./mu2e\-viewer.yaml ,
.IR ./config.yaml ,
.IR ./config/mu2e\-viewer.yaml ,
.I ./config/config.yaml
is used, relative to the
.B current working directory
(not the script directory, despite the
.B \-\-help
text).
The start script changes to the checkout first, so it finds
.IR config/mu2e\-viewer.yaml .
Run from elsewhere with no file found, the built-in
.B formats_dir
of
.B .\&
resolves to the checkout root, which holds no format files, and the format
list is empty.
.PP
Precedence: command-line
.I formats_dir
over
.B CRS_PORT_LISTEN
(for
.B viewer.port
only) over this file over the built-in defaults.
.PP
.B File \(-> Save config
in either program writes the current UI state in this format.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B formats_dir
Directory of packet-format YAML files, relative to the configuration file.
Shipped:
.BR ../formats .
Built-in default:
.BR .\& .
.TP
.B default_format
Format
.B name
selected at start; empty selects the first alphabetically.
.TP
.B viewer.port
Listen port, default 7755.
Overridden by
.BR CRS_PORT_LISTEN .
Also the port announced by discovery.
.TP
.B viewer.protocol
.B TCP
(default) or
.BR UDP .
Not in the shipped file; written by
.BR "Save config" .
.TP
.BR sender.host ", " sender.port
Initial destination for the sender; defaults
.B localhost
and 7755.
.TP
.B sender.protocol
.B TCP
or
.BR UDP .
.TP
.B font_size
Points, 7\(en24; default 11.
.TP
.B qt_style
Qt style name, default
.BR Fusion .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CRS_PORT_LISTEN
Replaces
.B viewer.port
when set.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
formats_dir: "../formats"
default_format: "Data Header Packet"
viewer:
  port: 7755
  protocol: UDP
sender:
  host: mu2e\-daq\-01
  port: 7755
font_size: 12
qt_style: Fusion
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.py (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-sender.py (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-formats.yaml (5)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
